      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.0,
      487.3,
      543.04,
      512.44
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me by section 6(2)(b) and section 21 (2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance (Chapter 269), I, Anura Karunathilaka, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing, do, by this Order,-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
